<title>EGYPT: Egypt banks, bourses closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Egypt banks, bourses closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's banks and bourses were closed on Wednesday for Revolution Day. They will reopen on Thursday.</p>
